*> Reads customers by key: CUST-ID is the record key, named only in
*> the SELECT; CUST-ACTIVE names CUST-STATUS.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CUSTREAD.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT CUSTOMERS ASSIGN TO CUSTFILE
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
        RECORD KEY IS CUST-ID.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  CUSTOMERS.
COPY custrec.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN INPUT CUSTOMERS
    READ CUSTOMERS
        INVALID KEY DISPLAY "NONE"
    END-READ
    IF CUST-ACTIVE
        DISPLAY CUST-NAME
    END-IF
    CLOSE CUSTOMERS
    GOBACK.
